      "summaries": {
        "en": "n8n-mcp is a Model Context Protocol server that enables AI assistants like Claude to create n8n workflows through natural language commands, bridging conversational AI with workflow automation. It works by exposing n8n's workflow-building capabilities as MCP tools that AI agents can call programmatically, demonstrating how protocol-based interfaces can make complex systems accessible to LLMs. Developers can integrate it with Claude Desktop or similar MCP-compatible tools to automate workflow creation, or extend it by adding custom n8n nodes as new MCP tools for specialized automation tasks.",
        "zh": "n8n-mcp 是一个 Model Context Protocol 服务器，它让 Claude 等 AI 助手能够通过自然语言指令创建 n8n 工作流，从而将对话式 AI 与自动化流程连接起来。该项目通过将 n8n 的工作流构建功能封装为 MCP 工具，使大型语言模型能够以编程方式调用这些功能，展示了协议化接口如何让复杂系统对 AI 代理变得可访问。开发者可以将其集成到 Claude Desktop 等兼容 MCP 的工具中，用自然语言快速生成自动化流程，或者通过添加自定义 n8n 节点作为新的 MCP 工具来扩展其功能，实现更专业的自动化场景。",
        "es": "n8n-mcp is a Model Context Protocol server that enables AI assistants like Claude to create n8n workflows through natural language commands, bridging conversational AI with workflow automation. It works by exposing n8n's workflow-building capabilities as MCP tools that AI agents can call programmatically, demonstrating how protocol-based interfaces can make complex systems accessible to LLMs. Developers can integrate it with Claude Desktop or similar MCP-compatible tools to automate workflow creation, or extend it by adding custom n8n nodes as new MCP tools for specialized automation tasks.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "n8n-mcp stands out for mcp, mcp-server, and n8n in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "n8n-mcp is a Model Context Protocol server that enables AI assistants like Claude to create n8n workflows through natural language commands, bridging conversational AI with workflow automation. It works by exposing n8n's workflow-building capabilities as MCP tools that AI agents can call programmatically, demonstrating how protocol-based interfaces can make complex systems accessible to LLMs. Developers can integrate it with Claude Desktop or similar MCP-compatible tools to automate workflow creation, or extend it by adding custom n8n nodes as new MCP tools for specialized automation tasks.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/czlonkowski/n8n-mcp for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
